sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kafka as Kafka orders topic
    participant Worker as Fulfillment consumer
    participant Store as Persistence fulfillment transaction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Kafka-->>Worker: OrderAccepted record
    Worker->>Store: fulfillment_event_is_processed(event_id)
    Store->>DB: Check processed marker to avoid delay on ordinary replay
    alt Previously processed
        DB-->>Store: Marker exists
        Store-->>Worker: Already processed, skip simulation delay
    else New event
        DB-->>Store: No marker
        Store-->>Worker: New event
        Worker->>Worker: Optional configured simulation delay
    end
    Worker->>Store: process_order_accepted(event)
    Store->>DB: Begin transaction, insert processed_events marker
    alt Concurrent or repeated delivery already processed
        DB-->>Store: Conflict, no new marker
        Store->>DB: Commit no-op transaction
        Store-->>Worker: Duplicate
        Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset
    else New event marker
        Store->>DB: Lock order and verify event customer
        alt Order is already shipped
            Store->>DB: Commit processed marker without another shipment
            Store-->>Worker: IgnoredAlreadyShipped
            Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset
        else Order is not accepted
            Store-->>Worker: InvalidEvent, transaction rolls back
            Worker->>Worker: Log and skip invalid record
            Worker->>Kafka: Commit skipped offset
        else Order is accepted
            Store->>DB: Compare event lines and saved stock reservations
            alt Event or reservation data does not match
                Store-->>Worker: InvalidEvent, transaction rolls back
                Worker->>Worker: Log and skip invalid record
                Worker->>Kafka: Commit skipped offset
            else Order and reservations match
                Store->>DB: Insert simulated shipment and tracking reference
                Store->>DB: Update order status to shipped
                Store->>DB: Enqueue OrderShipped in outbox
                Store->>DB: Commit marker, shipment, status, and event
                DB-->>Store: Commit succeeded
                Store-->>Worker: Shipped(tracking_reference)
                Worker->>Kafka: Commit offset after DB commit
            end
        end
    end
    Note over Store,DB: No stock changes here, inventory was reserved on acceptance.
